  "prefLabel": "Ph 2301.08 Investigational Drugs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2301.08 Investigational Drugs. lnvestigationa1 drugs for research shall be used only under the authority of the principal investigator. Such drugs shall be controlled by the pharmacy and shall be labeled according to the research protocols. The principal investigator shall provide essential information on such drugs to the current treatment team.\n\nSource. #13323, eff 1-5-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
